flowchart TD
    Proposal[Feature proposal] --> Rust[Rust API]
    Proposal --> CABI[C ABI]
    Proposal --> Host[Host-language APIs]
    Rust --> Matrix[Compatibility matrix]
    CABI --> Matrix
    Host --> Matrix
    Matrix --> ADR{ADR needed?}
